cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Agentic Development Protocol, please cite the preprint below."
title: "The Agentic Development Protocol"
abstract: >-
  An open, self-falsifying process standard for shipping production software
  with AI agent teams. ADP runs parallel AI agent sessions against a single
  repository with verification instead of trust: every rule is earned through a
  numbered production miss, every claim carries an evidence grade, and the
  protocol publishes its own falsification record.
